@startuml Cancel Order Sequence Diagram
title 撤单流程（支持 orderId 和 clientOrderId）

actor Client
participant "OrderController" as Controller
participant "CancelRequest\nDTO" as RequestDTO
participant "OrderEvent\nProducer" as Producer
participant "Disruptor\nRingBuffer" as Disruptor
participant "OrderEvent\nHandler" as Handler
participant "MatchingEngine\nManager" as Manager
participant "MatchingEngine" as Engine
participant "ClientOrder\nIndex" as Index
participant "L3OrderBook" as OrderBook
participant "WalWriter" as WAL

Client -> Controller: POST /api/cancel
activate Controller

Controller -> RequestDTO: 创建 CancelRequest
activate RequestDTO
RequestDTO --> Controller: {orderId/clientOrderId,\nsymbol}
deactivate RequestDTO

Controller -> Controller: 转换为 Order
Controller -> Producer: publish(event)
activate Producer

Producer -> Disruptor: 发布到环形缓冲区
activate Disruptor
Disruptor --> Producer
deactivate Disruptor
deactivate Producer

== Disruptor 消费撤单事件 ==

Disruptor -> Handler: onEvent(event, action=CANCEL)
activate Handler

Handler -> Manager: getEngine(symbol)
activate Manager
Manager --> Handler: 返回 MatchingEngine
deactivate Manager

note right of Handler
  判断撤单方式：
  - clientOrderId 非空：需转换
  - 否则直接使用 orderId
end note

alt 使用 clientOrderId 撤单
    Handler -> Index: getOrderId(symbol, clientOrderId)
    activate Index
    Index --> Handler: 返回 orderId
    deactivate Index

    alt orderId 未找到
        Handler -> Handler: log.warn\n"clientOrderId not found"
        Handler --> Client: 撤单失败
        deactivate Handler
        return
    end
end

note right of Handler
  1. 先写入 WAL (写前日志)
end note

Handler -> WAL: appendOrderCancel(orderId)
activate WAL
WAL -> WAL: 序列化 ORDER_CANCEL|...\nfsync 强制刷盘
WAL --> Handler
deactivate WAL

Handler -> Engine: cancelOrder(orderId)
activate Engine

Engine -> OrderBook: cancelOrder(orderId)
activate OrderBook

OrderBook -> OrderBook: 从索引中查找 OrderEntry
OrderBook -> OrderBook: 从价格档位中移除
OrderBook -> OrderBook: 更新深度

OrderBook --> Engine: 返回 success/fail
deactivate OrderBook

alt 撤单成功
    Engine --> Handler: true
    deactivate Engine

    note right of Handler
      2. 清理索引映射
    end note

    Handler -> Index: remove(orderId)
    activate Index
    Index --> Handler
    deactivate Index

    Handler --> Client: Cancel submitted
else 撤单失败
    Engine --> Handler: false
    deactivate Engine

    Handler -> Handler: log.warn\n"order not found"
    Handler --> Client: 撤单失败
end

deactivate Handler

Controller --> Client: 返回响应
deactivate Controller

@enduml
